<title>USA: Mitsubishi September US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi September US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    11,208	     6,631	    +76.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		 3,392	     4,864	    -27.4</p>
<p> Import Truck		 809	     2,046	    -58.8</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    96,327	    77,639	    +23.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		32,072	    60,112	    -46.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	    11,929	    17,264	    -31.2</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
